# fm1-soc's script (ms:what): eN:clicks a knob (0 = K1), aN:V an analog input (pads 0..15 by force, faders 16..19, wheels 20 21,
# the pedal 22), a name a button (held; name^ lets go), kN@V a key at velocity V. Comma separated (the # lines are dropped).
# K1 wakes the screen from the logo; the upper 4' out twice (pad 11, bottom), the 16' in once (pad 0, top), the 2 2/3' held out
300:e0:1,
600:a11:900, 700:a11:0, 800:a11:900, 900:a11:0, 1100:a0:900, 1200:a0:0, 1300:a12:900, 2200:a12:0,
# fader 1: the upper 1' (to about 4), fader 2: the bass +5 dB
2300:a16:560, 2400:a17:800,
# KNOB BANK + FADER BANK: the pads (and the screen) to the lower manual; the lower 8' in (pad 2, top)
2700:knobbank, 2710:faderbank, 2900:faderbank^, 2910:knobbank^, 3000:a2:900, 3100:a2:0,
# FADER BANK: bank B; the mod wheel: its place, up (fast), down (slow), middle (stop)
3200:faderbank, 3300:faderbank^, 3350:a21:560, 3600:a21:470, 3900:a21:629, 4200:a21:550,
# K7: the swell down; the lowest C; > the next preset
4300:e6:-5, 4600:k0@100, 4900:k0^, 4950:>, 5000:>^
